Change: Validate usernames from `--proxy-auth-username`

With `--proxy-auth-username`, rest-server previously accepted any username
from the configured header. Usernames from that header must now match the
same rules as usernames in `.htpasswd`, meaning digits and the characters
`@`, `.`, `_` and `-`. Requests with any other username are now rejected
with HTTP status 401.

https://github.com/restic/rest-server/pull/415
